  "prefLabel": "En 902.03 Alternative net metering tariff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 902.03 “Alternative net metering tariff” means the alternative net energy metering tariff provisions adopted by the commission pursuant to RSA 362-A:9, XVI which tariff provisions are applicable to customer-generators receiving a utility net metering capacity allocation on or after September 1, 2017.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
